@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   實作
' chapter:      7-1
' realizes:     NFR-01, NFR-02, NFR-06, NFR-12
' source:       .github/workflows/deploy.yml, backend/src/server.js, CLAUDE.md「部署與對外連線（VM）」節（程式碼與現況文件）
' verified:     2026-09-21
' status:       draft
' implemented:  partial
' ai-assisted:  yes / Claude Sonnet 5 / 依 CLAUDE.md 部署節核對後修正 LINE webhook 實際路徑並移除進度揭露文字
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title 正式環境佈署圖
left to right direction

node "使用者裝置" as Client {
  artifact "Web Browser\nReact SPA" as Browser
  artifact "LINE App" as LineApp
}

node "應用主機\nRocky Linux 9" as Vm {
  node "Nginx" as Nginx {
    artifact "frontend/focus-flow/dist" as Static
    artifact "HTTPS reverse proxy config" as ProxyConfig
  }
  node "ngrok tunnel\n（systemd 常駐）" as Ngrok
  node "PM2 / Node.js" as NodeRuntime {
    artifact "backend/src/server.js" as Backend
  }
  node "Python 執行環境" as PyRuntime {
    artifact "STT_Whisper/src/main.py\n與 batch_main.py" as Pipeline
    artifact "runs/<runId>/ manifests" as RunArtifacts
  }
}

cloud "外部受管服務" as External {
  database "MongoDB Atlas\n含 Vector Search" as Atlas
  artifact "Gemini／OpenAI API" as AiProvider
  artifact "LINE Messaging API" as LineApi
  artifact "YouTube Data API" as Youtube
  artifact "SMTP service" as Smtp
}

Browser --> Nginx : HTTPS 443
Nginx --> Static : serve static files
Nginx --> Backend : HTTP localhost:4000\n/api/*
LineApp --> Ngrok : HTTPS webhook\n（ngrok-free.dev 公開網域）
Ngrok --> Backend : tunnel to localhost:4000\n（不經 Nginx／443）
Backend --> Pipeline : local process / CLI request
Pipeline --> Backend : HTTPS/HTTP internal webhook\nX-Processing-Secret
Backend --> Atlas : TLS / MongoDB driver
Pipeline --> Atlas : TLS / pymongo upsert
Backend --> AiProvider : HTTPS JSON
Backend --> LineApi : HTTPS JSON
Backend --> Youtube : HTTPS OAuth 2.0
Backend --> Smtp : SMTP/TLS
Pipeline --> RunArtifacts : local file I/O

note bottom of Vm
  LINE webhook 目前經由 ngrok 常駐通道直達 4000 埠，不經 Nginx 443；
  對外 80 埠不通，僅 443 對外提供 HTTPS。憑證、feature flag
  與各外部服務的實際可用狀態以 `/health` 為準，不在本圖表示範圍內。
end note

@enduml
